ceptor  Insufficient tissue  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  07 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 13 27 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a piece of fibroadipose tissue  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  with a needle localization wire attached and an accompanying specimen x ray  There is a firm  palpable nodule  The specimen is inked and sectioned  revealing a firm  ill defined  pink gray mass  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  grossly abutting a inked surface  A representative section is frozen as Frozen Section  1 and saved frozen  The remaining parenchyma is soft  fibroadipose tissue with focal hemorrhage  Tissue is sent for estrogen receptors and BRDU studies  The remaining tissue is submitted in A through I  Resident  Cynthia E  Flynn  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Jo Ann E  Haney  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Teri L  Moore  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  David William Rattner  M D  Michael P Manning  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST TISSUE   report_end  , Grossly_positive.
