ned with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  25 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 14 43 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the frozen section lab  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  right breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm breast tissue  This specimen has 3 stitches  1 short and 1 long marking the superficial portion  2 long stitches marking the superior margin and 2 short stitches marking the medial margin  This specimen is inked black and red  over black in the superior area and medial areas  Sectioning discloses a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm spiculated hard area spanning the superior margin  within REMOVED_DATE to 0 2cm of it  A representative section is frozen as FX 1 now submitted in cassette H  The specimen is entirely submitted with the superficial portion in cassette A and B  the deep  or inferior portion  in G  and the remainder submitted entirely from superficial to deep in C F  Resident  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 RIGHT BREAST RESECTION  INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  ESTHER OLIVA  MD O R  Diagnosis by  G  Richard Dickersin  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Grossly_close_(multifocal/_broad_front).
