vity to anterior inferior margin  D  Cavity to superior anterior margin  E  Cavity to posterior superior margin  F  Cavity to anterior inferior margin  G  Cavity to anterior margin  H I  Full thickness sections  J  Lateral most margin  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margin  superior half of cavity   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm aggregate of fibrofatty breast tissue fragments  in which residual tumor is not grossly appreciated  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as K N  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shave margin  anterior half of cavity   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm aggregate of fibrofatty breast tissue fragments  in which residual tumor is not grossly appreciated  Specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as O R  Gross Description by  LORI MARINI Resident  NICOLE ANN BELSLEY  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Susan J Seward  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST RIGHT SUPERIOR REMOVED_DATE OF CAVITY  FINAL SHAVED PART C  BREAST RIGHT INFERIOR REMOVED_DATE OF CAVITY  FINAL SHAVED , Negative.
