E AMPLIFICATION Breast  Left  block J   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates HER 2 neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  01 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 11 52 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast lumpectomy short stitch superior  long stitch lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm portion of tan pink fibroadipose tissue with a short black stitch designating the superior and a long stitch the lateral margin  The posterior margin is inked black  the anterior blue  the superior green  and the inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm indurated gray white  well defined mass which abuts the inferior margin and comes to 0 1cm of the anterior  0 3cm of the posterior  1 4cm of the medial  2 2cm of the lateral  and 2 5cm of the superior margins  Arising 0 1cm lateral to the first mass is a second fairly well defined  elongated  gray white indurated mass which is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  The second mass abuts the anterior and inferior margins and comes to 1 0cm of the posterior  1 2cm of the lateral  and 1 4cm of the superior  2 8cm of the medial margins  A third gray white  indurated  fairly well defined mass is noted 0 3cm posterior to the second and 1 3cm posterolateral to the first  The third mass is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm and abuts the posterior margin  The third mass also comes to 0 5cm of the inferior  0 7cm of the superior  0 7cm of the lateral  0 9cm of the anterior  and 2 8cm of the medial margins  The specimen is entirely submitted from medial to lateral as A L as follows  A  Medial end  B  