er grossly unremarkable nipple  The specimen is oriented with a short stitch designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The specimen is inked as follows  Posterior   black  anterior   blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm cavity consistent with a prior biopsy site located within the lower outer quadrant of the specimen  The cavity extends to within 1 1cm of the nearest posterior margin and 2 5cm of the nearest anterior margin  The tissue surrounding the cavity is gray white  nodular and fibrous  The remainder of the cut surface consists of diffusely nodular gray white fibrous tissue with focal cystic areas and a scant amount of interspersed lobulated fat  The lateral aspect of the specimen is palpated  no lymph nodes are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of nodular fibrous tissue away from cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Area with   intraluminal necrosis near anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remainder of cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Prominent glandular tissue near anterior margin  Received fresh  labeled  left breast simple mastectomy   is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm left breast simple mastectomy specimen which is partially surfaced by a REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm wrinkled tan nipple areolar complex with a centrally 1 5cm in diameter grossly unremarkable nipple  The specimen is oriented with a short stitch designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The specimen is inked as follows  Posterior   black  anterior   blue  The specimen is serially sectioned  Sectioning reveals a gray white  nodular fibrous cut surface with a scant amount of interspersed tan yellow  lobulated fat  There are multiple cystic areas within the fibrous tissue and which contain gray green  mucoid material  A small  tan  indistinct lesion with a flat cu