ubmitted as follows  G H  Biopsy cavity to posterior margin  I  Biopsy cavity to closest anterior 12 o clock margin  J  Biopsy cavity to skin  K L  Representative sections away from biopsy cavity  6 o clock   Also received in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm tan yellow lobular aggregate containing multiple rubbery lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  Lymph nodes are submitted in cassettes  M O  Whole lymph nodes  P  Representative sections node  Gross Description by  KRISTEN SMITH Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST AND AXILLARY CONTENTS  LEFT    report_end  , Negative.
