one binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  29 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 09 52     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     THIS ADDENDUM HAS BEEN DELETED FOR THIS REPORT GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast tissue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm fragment of fibrofatty tissue with an associated skin ellipse that measures REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm and contains a healed scar that runs in a vertical direction  A safety pin was placed to denote the superior aspect of the specimen  The specimen was inked and sectioned to reveal  a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm biopsy cavity filled with red clot  The closest margin to the biopsy cavity is the anterior surface which is 0 2cm away  In addition  there are two cystic spaces  One measuring 0 2cm in diameter and the other 0 1cm in diameter in the most superior aspect of the specimens  Section Code  A  biopsy cavity with anterior margin  anterior margin has the largest straight surface area   B  biopsy cavity with anterior  long  and medial  short  margins C  biopsy cavity with anterior  short  and posterior  long  resection margin D  representative section of inferior portion of specimen  the anterior margin is not inked  E  superior resection margin  en face including two cystic areas F  biopsy cavity with anterior margin  G  biopsy cavity with the posterior margins inked H  biopsy cavity has been removed  this is the posterior  long  inferior  short  resection margins I  biopsy cavity has been excised  posterior  long  inferior  short  resection margin are included  Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Barbara Joyce Nath  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION , Grossly_close_(multifocal/_broad_front).
