gate  these are entirely submitted in F H  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin   are multiple fragments of fatty tissue  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm in aggregate  which are entirely submitted in I N  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary lymph node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm fatty tissue fragment bearing multiple lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  The small lymph nodes are submitted entirely in O Q  a large lymph node is bisected and entirely submitted in R  and one half of the largest lymph node is submitted in S U  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast additional lymph node   are multiple fragments of adipose tissue  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm in aggregate  containing three lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The largest lymph node is bisected and entirely submitted in V  the smaller lymph nodes are entirely submitted in W  Resident  SONER ALTIOK  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  BREAST MASS  RIGHT  COLLOID CARCINOMA  THE MARGINS APPEAR FREE GROSSLY  O R  Resident  Mari Mino  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robert Henry Young  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  Dennis C Sgroi  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA  PART C  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA  ADDITIONAL  PART D  BREAST  RIGHT  ADDITIONAL DEEP MARGIN  PART E  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN  , Negative.
