icating anterior  long stitch indicating lateral  and the bowtie indicating superior  The anterior is inked blue  the posterior black  the lateral yellow  and the medial green  The specimen is serially sectioned from superior to inferior to reveal a biopsy cavity occupying approximately middle portion of the specimen and measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The cavity is 0 25cm from the anterior resection margin  1 5cm from the posterior resection margin  2 2cm from the medial resection margin  and 2 4cm from the lateral resection margin  The breast tissue around the cavity is diffusely thickened  and hard in consistency  The superior aspect of the specimen also contains an area of focal nodularity  0 9cm   that approaches the nearest margin to within approximately 1cm  Four representative sections of the biopsy cavity are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  including the nearest margin  Two sections of the nodular area in the superior aspect of the specimen submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Two additional representative sections are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Aleksandr Vasilyev M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Aleksandr Vasilyev M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Dennis Sgroi M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA  PRIMARY SENTINEL   459   EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA  SECONDARY SENTINEL   120   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION , Negative.
Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report  MS 04  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  CASE  MS 04  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REMOVED_PATIENT_NAME  Date Taken  REMOVED_DATE Source Care Unit  Same Day Surgery  WACC 3 Frozen Section Pathologist  None Frozen Section Resident  None Frozen Section Consultant s   None Consulting Pathologist s   None Assigned Resident Path  Arnell M D   Paula Reports To  MICHELE ANNETTE GADD  M D  CLINICAL DATA  Stitch 12 o clock  Left simple mastectomy  FINAL DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY  RESIDUAL INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  GRADE REMOVED_DATE SEE NOTE  HEALING BIOPSY CAVITY  NOTE  The residual carcinoma consists of multiple scattered small foci of tumor found both within and beyond the region of the healing biopsy cavity  involving 7 out of 11 slides  The majority of the tumor appears to be within lymphatic vessels  Tumor within lymphatic vessels comes to  0 1cm of the posterior resection margin focally  An immunoperoxidase stain for  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  helps confirm the presence of tumor within lymphatic vessels  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 4cm left simple mastectomy specimen with a black stitch at 12 o clock as per requisition  The specimen is freshly surfaced by a 29 x 9 0cm roughly elliptical portion of tan pink skin  There is a 3 0cm eccentric areola which comes to 2 7cm of the skin margin  The REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tan pink nipple is grossly unremarkable  There is a 3 0cm healed linear scar along the lateral aspect of the areola which comes to 2 9cm of the closest  inferior  skin margin  The anterior resection margin is inked blue  and the posterior black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 2cm hemorrhagic cavity which focally abuts the  posterior  margin  The cavity is lined by yellow orange tissue consistent with fat necrosis and contains soft red brown tissue  The wall of the cavity averages 0 2cm  and there is surrounding dense white fibrous tissue with no discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities  The remaining cut surfaces show unremarkable fibrofatty breast tissue  Sectioning of the lateral breast tissue reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm hemorrhagic firm area with yellow orange discoloration consistent with fat necrosis  No apparent lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavity to deep margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved fibrous tissue away from cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative hemorrhagic area with fat necrosis in upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections of skin and anterior margin  Gross Dictation by Stephanie Kuehn  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Paula Arnell M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Paula Arnell M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Negative.
